                ['q'=>'What payment methods do you accept?','a'=>'We accept all debit and credit cards, bank transfer, USSD, and mobile banking — all processed securely through Paystack.'],
                ['q'=>'Can I return or exchange an item?','a'=>'Yes. You have 7 days from delivery to request a return or exchange. Items must be unworn and in original condition. WhatsApp us to start the process.'],
                ['q'=>'Do you deliver to all states in Nigeria?','a'=>'Yes — we deliver to all 36 states and FCT. Delivery fees vary by state, and orders above ₦50,000 get free delivery.'],
                ['q'=>'How do I know my size?','a'=>'Each product page has a size guide. Our tees and hoodies are oversized — if you prefer a slimmer fit, size down. Still unsure? WhatsApp us.'],
